  "title": "Business Metrics",
  "description": "Current state of the business: users by sign-in method, orders by tracking status, and email delivery. Every card is a SQL query over a metrics stream, so it follows the dashboard's time picker and reads 0 over a quiet range instead of erroring. Counters (Registrations, Emails sent/lost) SUM over the selected range; gauges (Users, Orders, Delivered/In progress/Tracked) report the level with MAX. The per-service golden-signal dashboards carry the time-series view.",
  "role": "",
  "owner": "3MRAI",
